# Web app — deps + build output (derived; regenerated)
web/node_modules/
web/dist/
web/*.tsbuildinfo
# NOTE: web/public/data/ IS tracked — it's the deployed browser dataset (PMTiles +
# facts parquet + small GeoJSON, ~50MB), shipped to GitHub Pages. Regenerate with
# `python -m build.export_web`. The big tippecanoe inputs live in data/_web_tiles_src
# (under the gitignored data/), so they are NOT committed.

